Third-party attribution
-----------------------

The following open-source projects are referenced or ported from. Their
original licenses are preserved and attributed below.

1. Aureole-Suite/Falcompress
   https://github.com/Aureole-Suite/Falcompress
   License: MIT OR Apache-2.0

   The BZip mode-2 bitstream layout, the compressor's match-search strategy,
   and the terminating sequence in this project are ported from:

       src/bzip/decompress.rs
       src/bzip/compress/mode2.rs
       src/bzip/mod.rs

2. Kyuuhachi - "Ys I/II/Origin/VI extractor"
   https://gist.github.com/Kyuuhachi/42b6acd38a99f7cc8d924286617a9c02

   The NNI archive (.na/.ni) table-of-contents de-obfuscation and the zlib
   handling of ".Z" entries are based on this work.
